{"channelId":"UCgeX9s-N9-r9l3BlC7-cQxw","row":["Goodheart Animal Sanctuaries",1330,"With the help of our valued supporters, we’re working towards a better future for farm animals through compassion, education, and advocacy. We care for over 300 rescued animals at our flagship site, Goodheart Farm Animal Sanctuary based in Worcestershire. As part of our dedicated Education Programme, we facilitate meaningful connections between visitors and our residents, helping to reshape perceptions of “so-called” farm animals and raise awareness of their suffering. Alongside this, we back national campaigns to prevent animal cruelty and inspire people of all generations to make compassionate lifestyle changes.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgeX9s-N9-r9l3BlC7-cQxw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgeX9s-N9-r9l3BlC7-cQxw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:11.974Z","channelId":"UCgeX9s-N9-r9l3BlC7-cQxw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"35434d19c0083b2186b2e59f8acdb66dbbc3dd8d4669f40b3d54f378e88c48d2","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"f92ffbc2b94b7ab8cc60a32a47bc51fe2060b5ae3d6e6e424e1494716b30fc9c"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgeX9s-N9-r9l3BlC7-cQxw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:11.974Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgeX9s-N9-r9l3BlC7-cQxw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1330,"raw":"1.33K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgeX9s-N9-r9l3BlC7-cQxw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:11.974Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服